 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't start Carlos Mendes's onboarding yet, for two reasons:\n\n1. No directory record. I searched for \"Carlos Mendes\" and \"Mendes\" and found no employee record. Under POL-ONB-01, onboarding needs a directory record with status pre_start, and if there isn't one, HR has to create it first. Please ask HR to create Carlos's pre_start record.\n\n2. Timing. Under POL-ONB-01, onboarding can start no earlier than 5 business days before the start date. For a start on Monday 30 November, the earliest date is Monday 23 November. Today is 17 November, so onboarding can be started from 23 November onward. The laptop is shipped to arrive the business day before the start date, so starting on 23 November or shortly after still covers his 30 November start.\n\nOnce HR has created the record and it's 23 November or later, ask me again (or have the manager or HR start onboarding) and I'll start it. Logins for systems beyond the department standard are requested separately after onboarding has started.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ONB-01"
 ]
}
